<hr class="human-note-divider" />
<button
  type="button"
  class="human-note"
  id="human-note"
  aria-controls="human-card"
  aria-expanded="false"
>
  <img
    src="/images/wcarhart.png"
    alt=""
    width="38"
    height="38"
    loading="lazy"
  />
  <span>These docs are written and reviewed by a human.</span>
</button>
<section
  id="human-card"
  class="human-card"
  popover="manual"
  aria-labelledby="human-card-title"
>
  <a
    class="human-card-profile"
    href="https://github.com/wcarhart"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    aria-label="wcarhart on GitHub"
  >
    <img
      src="/images/wcarhart.png"
      alt="Will Carhart"
      width="120"
      height="120"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <span class="human-card-badge">wcarhart</span>
  </a>
  <h2 id="human-card-title">Hi, I'm Will!</h2>
  <p>
    I maintain koi and I am indeed a human. I care a lot about these docs being
    easy to read for humans (and agents), so they're always written and reviewed
    by hand. If you find a typo or inconsistency, please open{' '}
    <a
      href="https://github.com/wcarhart/koi/issues/new"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      an issue
    </a>
    .
  </p>
</section>
